        },
        {
          "tweetId": "2108558956327010351",
          "text": "“Copper is the great enabler of electrification — but the accelerating pace of electrification is an increasing challenge for #Copper. Supply is not on track to keep pace.”\n\nDaniel Yergin, Vice Chairman, \n@SPGlobal\n\n\n\n$NINE\n \n$NINE.CN\n \n\n 5/6",
