        },
        {
          "tweetId": "2108558952816312373",
          "text": "The numbers behind the gap:\n\nAbout 9 Mt copper supply deficit by 2030 (\n@BMO\n Capital Markets)\n\nMore than US$100B needed to build new supply (\n@crugroup\n)\n\nAbout 50% global demand growth to 2040 (\n@SPGlobal\n)\n\nAbout 30% supply shortfall projected by 2035 (\n@IEA\n )\n\n\n$NINE\n \n$NINE.CN\n $VMSXF",
